commit a87bec43d8cf2552cc755d5035d1b99414bbeccf

C03: a final after an opening plus a read must report the opening too (APPS1383)

APPS1231 measured «abrí la calculadora y decime qué hora es»: app.open and system.time both ran and verified, and the final only gave the time.

llm._payload_fact_defect: when the visible payload carries a completed app.open among the earlier steps and the final never says the application was opened (abrir/open/lanzar/iniciar), the defect missing_prior_open sends the draft back with a hint; the clock checks already cover the time. No fixed reply.

No .NET change. Offline probe only; tests not run (owner order).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>


